Android: Automatic discovery of  compatible ChromeDriver
========================================================
No Need to manage ChromeDriver versions. Appium can automatically download the compatible
ChromeDriver and use it for automating the browser.

To download to default location
===============================
appium --allow-insecure chromedriver_autodownload

To download to custom location
==============================
chromedriverExecutableDir
options.setCapability("chromedriverExecutableDir", "Path");